   "body": "**Capture result** (PR #435, 2026-11-02): `T20`-`T24` (cookie-less). Without a `Referer`, `reho.st` answers **403** on `/` and on an image path (`/self/abc123.jpg`); with `Referer: https://forum.hardware.fr/` or the legacy value without the slash it answers 200 (empty `text/html`). Limit: the path names no existing image, so a real image served with the Referer is not observed — no `reho.st` image was found on three recent public topic pages (they use `rehost.diberie.com`). The http-only part is in #301. Settles E26's Referer half: the LOT-056 table's Referer value (with or without slash) is accepted. HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-056 and §7 E26 updated.",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
